Third-party dependencies and models
-----------------------------------

This package interoperates with, but does not distribute:

- Hugging Face diffusers (Apache-2.0). The register implementations depend on
  the internal attribute layout of the SD3/FLUX transformer blocks, so
  the revision is pinned in pyproject.toml. Upgrading may change numerics.
- Stable Diffusion 3 Medium and FLUX.1-dev model weights, each
  subject to its own upstream license and access terms.
- Teacher reward models used to produce training scores: HPSv3, PickScore v1,
  and ImageReward, each under its own license.

Model weights, datasets, and teacher checkpoints are not included in this
repository and must be obtained from their respective sources.
